{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an officially authorized derivative RPG fan game created in accordance with lainTTL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will meet Lain again in a world without gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story is set in the near future, where the old human race lives in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They have been largely divided into the new human race, who have abandoned the real world and live in a world of computer technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story begins one day, when Lain receives an email and a file.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why did people lose their connections? How can they be reconnected?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist, Lain Iwakura, searches for the truth while interacting with various people she was involved with in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632010/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-04-17_155744.png?t=1745480917\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You become Lain Iwakura and explore the Wired world while interacting with an AI that contains the records of those who were once involved with Lain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632010/extras/alice.jpg?t=1745480917\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">operation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By writing a diary and reading emails, you will find the key to the mystery of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632010/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-04-17_155557.png?t=1745480917\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Furthermore, you can create your own world by customizing the computer NAVI, and the story changes by rearranging the files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632010/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-04-17_155453.png?t=1745480917\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, various elements such as status functions, clothing changing functions, and character affinity functions are intertwined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3632010?t=1745480917","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632010/5c1b57029b342a164b74ddd508e04f862adeb763/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745480917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632010/7edee2d5d30d1de97317cfa15893c32674ad68fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745480917","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632010/7edee2d5d30d1de97317cfa15893c32674ad68fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745480917","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3632190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an officially authorized derivative RPG fan game created in accordance with lainTTL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will meet Lain again in a world without gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story is set in the near future, where the old human race lives in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They have been largely divided into the new human race, who have abandoned the real world and live in a world of computer technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story begins one day, when Lain receives an email and a file.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why did people lose their connections? How can they be reconnected?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist, Lain Iwakura, searches for the truth while interacting with various people she was involved with in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632010/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-04-17_155744.png?t=1745480917\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You become Lain Iwakura and explore the Wired world while interacting with an AI that contains the records of those who were once involved with Lain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632010/extras/alice.jpg?t=1745480917\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">operation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By writing a diary and reading emails, you will find the key to the mystery of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632010/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-04-17_155557.png?t=1745480917\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Furthermore, you can create your own world by customizing the computer NAVI, and the story changes by rearranging the files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632010/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-04-17_155453.png?t=1745480917\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, various elements such as status functions, clothing changing functions, and character affinity functions are intertwined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["team_MJM"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st